     5976           for each temp-gds  break by temp-gds.obj-type by temp-gds.obj-code  by if xSortType = "sort-code" then  temp-gds.sb-code Else (if xSortType = "sort-artic" then  temp-gds.artic Else  temp-gds.gds-name) :
     5977             if first-of(temp-gds.obj-code) then run PrintName ( temp-gds.obj-name ) .
